# TIP 1eec5a351. Owner OWN password change (Store Panel profile) does not rotate login_remember_token, so an older logged-in SESSION of the same owner keeps passing every panel.session route.
A3(ii) vendor owner BEFORE own password change: BASE session=404 BASE recaller-only=404 | TIP session=404 TIP recaller-only=403
A3(ii) owner changes own password via Store Panel profile -> 302 http://127.0.0.1:8171/vendor-panel/profile/view
A3(ii) vendor owner AFTER own password change (old sessions + base-issued recaller): BASE session=404 BASE recaller-only=404 | TIP session=404 TIP recaller-only=403
A3(ii) changer's own TIP session after change = 404
A3(ii) login with NEW password -> 302 http://127.0.0.1:8171/vendor-panel; guard-only route = 404
A3(ii) NEW owner password = <redacted-clone-pw>
